Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 20:27:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 149/159] [ae-patch] Show draft pull requests in the action
 dock with a Mark ready button
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The dock listed only pull requests ready to merge, and a draft's mergeable
state is "draft", so drafts never appeared. A draft now gets its own line,
"#n draft · x/y checks", ranked after merges, with Mark ready (the card's
own mutation, moved to hooks/useAeMarkReady.ts). Once ready and green it
becomes the Merge line.
